      "root": {
        "title": "",
        "text": "Project-wide guidance: follow docs/specs as authoritative; write tests first and keep make test green; follow the established Python conventions and feature-package layout; keep runtime dependencies and hexa integration boundaries strict; do not delegate without user authorization; preserve designated inspiration sources as read-only and use /tmp/opencode for temporary work; describe only implemented spec support; and keep durable design knowledge in .memo/domain while TODO.md tracks open work only.",
