      "test-first-green": {
        "title": "Test first and keep tests green",
        "text": "For implementation work, write tests first and keep each step green with make test (pytest via uv). Name tests tests/T{spec}-{n}-{feature}-{name}.py, avoid network by replaying journals, and skip hexa-dependent tests when hexa is unavailable. Use domain/pattern:SpecExamplesAsTests as canonical test guidance.",
